      traffic to eth1:       ff1e::1:500 20/20,  ff1e::1:501 20/20
  eth1 leaves both groups (the kernel's MLDv2 leave when the join sockets close)
  AFTER the leave (8 s)
      show ipv6 mld groups:  ff1e::1:500 vlan20 Expires "stopped" (still listed); ff1e::1:501 GONE
      traffic to eth1:       ff1e::1:500 20/20 (static, unaffected),  ff1e::1:501 0/20
      show ipv6 mroute ff1e::1:500 -> out vlan20;  ff1e::1:501 -> empty outgoing list
